  {
    "id" : "category_apex_security_ApexSOQLInjection",
    "level" : "Error",
    "category" : "Security",
    "subCategory" : "SQLInjection",
    "title" : "Avoid Apex SOQL Injection",
    "description" : "Detects and prevents the usage of untrusted or unescaped variables in Apex SOQL queries to avoid SOQL injection vulnerabilities.",
    "explanation" : "Since: PMD 5.5.3\n\nDetects the usage of untrusted / unescaped variables in DML queries.\n\nExample(s):\n```\npublic class Foo {\n    public void test1(String t1) {\n        Database.query('SELECT Id FROM Account' + t1);\n    }\n}\n```",
    "enabled" : true,
    "timeToFix" : 10,
