    "title" : "Enforce Remote Session Interface Naming Convention",
    "description" : "Ensures that Remote Home interfaces of Session EJBs are named with the suffix 'Home'.",
    "explanation" : "Since: PMD 4.0\n\nA Remote Home interface type of a Session EJB should be suffixed by 'Home'.\n\nExample(s):\n```\npublic interface MyBeautifulHome extends javax.ejb.EJBHome {}       // proper name\n\npublic interface MissingProperSuffix extends javax.ejb.EJBHome {}   // non-standard name\n```",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
      {
        "name" : "Java"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "category_java_codestyle_ShortClassName",
    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "CodeStyle",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Short Class Names",
    "description" : "This rule discourages the use of short class names, typically those with fewer than five characters.",
    "explanation" : "Since: PMD 5.0\n\nShort Classnames with fewer than e.g. five characters are not recommended.\n\nExample(s):\n```\npublic class Foo {\n}\n```",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
    "parameters" : [
