    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Using 'class' Attribute",
    "description" : "This rule enforces not using an attribute named 'class' in JSP or HTML code.",
    "explanation" : "Since: PMD 3.6\n\nDo not use an attribute called 'class'. Use &quot;styleclass&quot; for CSS styles.\n\nExample(s):\n```\n<HTML> <BODY>\n<P class=\"MajorHeading\">Some text</P>\n</BODY> </HTML>\n```",
